  "proof_chain": [
    "For p in its original root cell and l in B p, original mark_pos and two finite single_le_sum bounds prove prefixWeight of that literal old list is strictly positive.",
    "The shared ActualHistoryScale.of_prefixWeight_ne_zero supplies positive w.prod and 1<cellQ/w.prod under the original actual n/N/t conditions. No scale or old-history decoding is duplicated here.",
    "Apply the existing fixed-word inner_sum_le_ordinaryBad_add_errors to that exact old word and same cellQ.",
    "Multiply by the original nonnegative levelMark, then sum over the unchanged original dependent B p, original p band and root cells.",
    "Use the existing original ordinaryBad and noncoprime cell identities to return to the original source formulas with coefficient one.",
    "Sum the same comparison over the existing fixed Fin 431 depth budget; the base remains an exact sum rather than a coarse multiple."
  ],
